# Vercel hosts the static landing page (index.html) and the widget (avatar_widget/). Project Root Directory is
# the repo root; deploy with `vercel deploy --prod --yes` from here. The bot and kb run on Render / a VPS.
/*
!/index.html
!/vercel.json
!/avatar_widget
/avatar_widget/evidence
/avatar_widget/test
/avatar_widget/__pycache__
/avatar_widget/serve.py
/avatar_widget/README.md
